    [condition_inverted] pair-mapping-cache-hit-on-shared-opening/followers-not-held-until-leaders-complete
      The ordering that lets later calls hit the cache depends on followers starting only after every leader has returned. If leaders and followers were mapped together or in the wrong order, the first calls for an opening would all start before any cache write lands and would all miss.
