    [scope_too_narrow] batch-api-opt-in/non-anthropic-stage-sent-directly
      Batching is gated on `_needs_explicit_marker(request["model"])`, so any call whose model that predicate does not recognise as Anthropic (for example a stage model override, or an Anthropic model reached under a different provider prefix) goes to the direct endpoint even though the run has batch enabled.
