  [already_present] min-reusable-prefix-per-model/dotted-sonnet-5-5-matches-sonnet-5
    candidate edits: 1 asked for, 0 set aside, none used
    pairs: 0 settled by the run, 4 put to the model, 0 dropped as not worth asking, 313 skipped once the defect was covered
    Line 254 only lowercases the name and strips the provider and `claude-` prefixes, and line 255 matches with startswith against hyphenated keys. A dotted id such as `claude-sonnet-5.5` becomes `sonnet-5.5`, which does not start with `sonnet-5-5` but does start with `sonnet-5`, so it resolves to 1024 instead of 512. The repair normalizes dots to hyphens before matching, so dotted Sonnet, Opus and Haiku 5.5 ids resolve to the 5-5 entries.

